<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10430"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 04, 2005 - 7:31 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->OK E...I will bring the pillow cases.....you bring the golf balls!  LOL<!--/Text--></td></tr>
